# MboaStock

A complete e-commerce and retail management app for small Cameroonian stores.

## Features
- Inventory management
- Sales tracking
- Customer management
- Supplier records
- Purchase order tracking
- Expense tracking
- Printable customer receipts
- Persistent SQLite database

## Login credentials
- Email: admin@mboastock.cm
- Password: admin123

## Run locally
```bash
npm install
npm start
```

Then open: http://localhost:3000

## Tech stack
- Node.js + Express
- SQLite3
- Vanilla JavaScript
